					"nextDialogs": [
						10030305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 10030305,
					"content": "#但這只是讓我不傷害{F#妳}{M#你}們的信物，並不代表{F#妳}{M#你}們不會受到傷害。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10030306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 10030306,
					"content": "呃…我不太明白…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10030307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10030307,
					"content": "過分接近仙與魔的世界，即為逾矩。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10030308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 10030308,
					"content": "人的靈魂不如仙人強韌，血液中也難以承載如此濃度的仙家氣運。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10030309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 10030309,
					"content": "#算是為{F#妳}{M#你}們好，趕緊離開吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10030310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 10030310,
					"content": "等一下，我們是來…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10030311
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10030311,
					"content": "啊，好生氣。這個人怎麼自說自話的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10030312
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10030312,
					"content": "好想幫他取個難聽的綽號…但要是得罪了仙人，以後發現寶箱的時候，會不會只能開出高麗菜…？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10030313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10030313,
					"content": "唉…我們還是去請教一下客棧的老闆娘，問問她怎麼和仙人正常交流吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
